<title>FRANCE: UGC to invest over 1 bln Ffr in cinemas.</title>
<headline>UGC to invest over 1 bln Ffr in cinemas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Movie theater chain UGC will invest more than one billion francs to build multiplex theaters in France and in Madrid this year, chairman Guy Verrecchia said in an interview in the newspaper Les Echos on Monday.</p>
</text>
